{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Lunar Knight of the Blood Moon, and tonight is your night.\u00a0 It's time for violence.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with a brutal blade and nimble bow, take the fight to the twisted horrors conjured by the Blood Moon.\u00a0\u00a0Gain experience, grow stronger, and synergize your weapons to crush the enemy forces and survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo contains introductory levels from the full version of Blood Moon Survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make heads roll.\u00a0 Take down punishing bosses with unique combos and abilities.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314000/extras/FightGif.gif?t=1747097594\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  Master swapping and dual wielding your weapons to mow down hordes of enemies.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314000/extras/PowerupGif.gif?t=1747097594\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combine your powers to discover their deadly, evolved forms.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314000/extras/EvolveGif.gif?t=1747097594\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3314000?t=1747097594","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314000/9699b1d4f314a951b7318c09c97f489d98e05e0a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747097594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314000/d8913b3eaea34f7344618f3829a2b031738700d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747097594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314000/d8913b3eaea34f7344618f3829a2b031738700d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747097594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo",